{
  "name": "01 Ingest FAQ PDF into Pinecone",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Overview – Workflow 01\n**Goal:** load the store FAQ/policy PDF into the Pinecone index `shopassist` so the agent can search it (RAG).\n\nFlow: Manual trigger → download PDF → split into 1000-char chunks (200 overlap) → embed with `text-embedding-3-small` (1536 dims) → insert with metadata `source = faq`.\n\n**Run once** (running again adds duplicates – clear the index first).\n\nCourse: Sessions 7–9 (RAG with Pinecone), 18 (metadata).",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "db4f7471-da8b-528f-a3bc-9d85846a32d2",
      "name": "Overview – Workflow 01",
