      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step notes\n- **Download FAQ PDF**: raw GitHub URL of `data/store_faq.pdf` (repo must be public). Alternative: replace with a *Google Drive → Download file* node.\n- **Default Data Loader** reads the binary PDF and adds metadata `source=faq` – the agent's `faq_knowledge` tool filters on it.\n- **Recursive Text Splitter**: chunk size 1000, overlap 200.\n- **OpenAI Embeddings**: 1536-dim vectors; index must use the same dimension and cosine.",
